    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>After landing successive blows against a single target, your melee and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks become more devastating.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +3</p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you hit a single target with two consecutive melee and/or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks during the same turn, any additional melee or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks you make until the end of your next turn (including <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a> and attacks made as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>) deal +1 die of damage on a hit. This extra damage stacks with extra damage granted by other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a>.</p>",
